            "detailed_description": "Witchinour is a roguelite twin stick shooter focused on fast, 60fps action and constantly increasing difficulty. You play as an explorer who comes across a dungeon that an apprentice witch named Nour found herself lost in years ago on a full moon...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Witchinour has:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>7 increasingly dangerous areas to fight (and loop) your way through<br></li><li>6 class abilities, 5 spells, 21 weapons, and 40 upgrades to help you descend the dungeon<br></li><li>1 dynamic difficulty system that wants you dead<br></li><li>6 levels of stacking difficulty modifiers to unlock to push your skills to the limit</li></ul>",
